<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl update t s =\n    s\n    |> update_span t 0 ##t","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl update t s =
      s
      |> update_span t 0 ##t
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### advance_while

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl advance_while (fn : char -> bool) (t : string) (i : int) (parser_state s' as s)\n    : int * parser_state\n    =\n    if i >= s'.text_length\n    then i, s\n    else\n        inl i' = i |> sm'.span_from fn t\n        inl i' =\n            if i' > s'.text_length\n            then s'.text_length\n            else i'\n        inl consumed = i' - i\n        if consumed = 0\n        then i, s\n        else i', s |> update_span t i consumed","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl advance_while (fn : char -> bool) (t : string) (i : int) (parser_state s' as s)
      : int * parser_state
      =
      if i >= s'.text_length
      then i, s
      else
          inl i' = i |> sm'.span_from fn t
          inl i' =
              if i' > s'.text_length
              then s'.text_length
              else i'
          inl consumed = i' - i
          if consumed = 0
          then i, s
          else i', s |> update_span t i consumed
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### run_parser

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl run_parser p t =\n    match p (t, 0, ##t |> new_parser_state') with\n    | Ok (result, i, (parser_state s' as s)) => Ok (result, t |> slice i s'.text_length, s)\n    | Error e => (fun () => e |> error_message t) |> Error","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl run_parser p t =
      match p (t, 0, ##t |> new_parser_state') with
      | Ok (result, i, (parser_state s' as s)) => Ok (result, t |> slice i s'.text_length, s)
      | Error e => (fun () => e |> error_message t) |> Error
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### any_char

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl any_char () : parser char = fun t, i, (parser_state s' as s) =>\n    if i >= s'.text_length then\n        fail (fun _, _, s => \"parsing.any_char / unexpected end of t / \" ++#? { s }) i s\n    else\n        inl c = t |> sm'.index i\n        Ok (c, i + 1, c |> update_char s)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl any_char () : parser char = fun t, i, (parser_state s' as s) =>
      if i >= s'.text_length then
          fail (fun _, _, s => "parsing.any_char / unexpected end of t / " ++#? { s }) i s
      else
          inl c = t |> sm'.index i
          Ok (c, i + 1, c |> update_char s)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

