<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> fsharp\n\n\"abc\"\n|> parse_ (p_char_ 'a')\n|> unwrap_format\n|> _assert_eq' #?*('a', ($'FParsec.Position (null, 0, 1, 2)' : position_))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> fsharp

