### skip_many

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl skip_many forall t. (p : parser t) : parser () = fun t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.skip_many\" fun () => { t_len = ##t; i s }\n    let rec 루프 (i' : int) (s' : parser_state) =\n        match p (t, i', s') with\n        | Error _ => Ok ((), i', s')\n        | Ok (_, i'', s'') =>\n            if i'' <> i'\n            then s'' |> 루프 i''\n            else fail (fun _ => \"parsing.skip_many / inner parser consumed no text\") i' s'\n    s |> 루프 i","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl skip_many forall t. (p : parser t) : parser () = fun t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.skip_many" fun () => { t_len = ##t; i s }
      let rec 루프 (i' : int) (s' : parser_state) =
          match p (t, i', s') with
          | Error _ => Ok ((), i', s')
          | Ok (_, i'', s'') =>
              if i'' <> i'
              then s'' |> 루프 i''
              else fail (fun _ => "parsing.skip_many / inner parser consumed no text") i' s'
      s |> 루프 i
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

