### skip_many1

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl skip_many1 forall t. (a : parser t) : parser () = fun t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.skip_many1\" fun () => { t_len = ##t; i s }\n    match a (t, i, s) with\n    | Error e => e |> Error\n    | Ok (_, i', s') =>\n        if i' <> i\n        then skip_many a (t, i', s')\n        else fail (fun _ => \"parsing.skip_many1 / inner parser consumed no text\") i' s'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl skip_many1 forall t. (a : parser t) : parser () = fun t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.skip_many1" fun () => { t_len = ##t; i s }
      match a (t, i, s) with
      | Error e => e |> Error
      | Ok (_, i', s') =>
          if i' <> i
          then skip_many a (t, i', s')
          else fail (fun _ => "parsing.skip_many1 / inner parser consumed no text") i' s'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

