### many

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl many forall b c.\n    (p : _ * _ * _ -> _ (b * _ * _) c)\n    : parser (list _)\n    =\n    fun t, i, s =>\n        trace_entry \"parsing.many\" fun () => { t_len = ##t }\n        let rec 루프 (acc : list b) (i' : int) (s' : parser_state)\n            : result (list b * int * parser_state) _\n            =\n            match p (t, i', s') with\n            | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm.rev, i', s')\n            | Ok (x, i'', s'') when i'' > i' => s'' |> 루프 (x :: acc) i''\n            | Ok _ => fail (fun _ => \"parsing.many / inner parser succeeded without consuming text\") i' s'\n        s |> 루프 [] i","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl many forall b c.
      (p : _ * _ * _ -> _ (b * _ * _) c)
      : parser (list _)
      =
      fun t, i, s =>
          trace_entry "parsing.many" fun () => { t_len = ##t }
          let rec 루프 (acc : list b) (i' : int) (s' : parser_state)
              : result (list b * int * parser_state) _
              =
              match p (t, i', s') with
              | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm.rev, i', s')
              | Ok (x, i'', s'') when i'' > i' => s'' |> 루프 (x :: acc) i''
              | Ok _ => fail (fun _ => "parsing.many / inner parser succeeded without consuming text") i' s'
          s |> 루프 [] i
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

