### many1_chars

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl many1_chars (p : parser char) : parser string = fun t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.many1_chars\" fun () => { t_len = ##t; i s }\n    match p (t, i, s) with\n    | Error e => e |> Error\n    | Ok (_, i', s') =>\n        let rec 루프 (i'' : int) (s'' : parser_state) : result (string * int * parser_state) _ =\n            match p (t, i'', s'') with\n            | Error _ => Ok (t |> slice i i'', i'', s'')\n            | Ok (_, i''', s''') =>\n                if i''' <> i''\n                then s''' |> 루프 i'''\n                else fail (fun _ => \"parsing.many1_chars / inner parser succeeded without consuming text\") i'' s''\n        s' |> 루프 i'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
