### many1_satisfy

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl many1_satisfy (fn : char -> bool) : parser string = fun t, i, (parser_state s' as s) =>\n    let rec 루프 (i' : int) (s'' : parser_state) : int * parser_state =\n        if i' >= s'.text_length\n        then i', s''\n        else\n            inl c = t |> sm'.index i'\n            if fn c\n            then 루프 (i' + 1) (c |> update_char s'')\n            else i', s''\n    inl i', s'' = 루프 i s\n    if i' > i\n    then Ok (t |> slice i i', i', s'')\n    else\n        fail (fun _, i, s => \"parsing.many1_satisfy / no matching char / \" ++#? { i s }) i s","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl many1_satisfy (fn : char -> bool) : parser string = fun t, i, (parser_state s' as s) =>
      let rec 루프 (i' : int) (s'' : parser_state) : int * parser_state =
          if i' >= s'.text_length
          then i', s''
          else
              inl c = t |> sm'.index i'
              if fn c
              then 루프 (i' + 1) (c |> update_char s'')
              else i', s''
      inl i', s'' = 루프 i s
      if i' > i
      then Ok (t |> slice i i', i', s'')
      else
          fail (fun _, i, s => "parsing.many1_satisfy / no matching char / " ++#? { i s }) i s
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

