### pipe2

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl pipe2 forall a b c. (p1 : parser a) (p2 : parser b) (f : ((() -> a) * (() -> b)) -> c) : parser c = fun t, i, s =>\n    match p1 (t, i, s) with\n    | Error e => e |> Error\n    | Ok (ra, i', s') =>\n        p2 (t, i', s')\n        |> resultm.map fun rb, i'', s'' =>\n            f ((fun () => ra), (fun () => rb)), i'', s''","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl pipe2 forall a b c. (p1 : parser a) (p2 : parser b) (f : ((() -> a) * (() -> b)) -> c) : parser c = fun t, i, s =>
      match p1 (t, i, s) with
      | Error e => e |> Error
      | Ok (ra, i', s') =>
          p2 (t, i', s')
          |> resultm.map fun rb, i'', s'' =>
              f ((fun () => ra), (fun () => rb)), i'', s''
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

